---
// src/pages/index.astro
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import YouTube from "../components/YouTube.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="Intentional Tech | Handheld Tech for Casual Gamers"
  description="Intentional Tech makes mindful videos on portable devices, from iPads to handheld gaming PCs and everything in between."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-label">Welcome to</div>
    <h1 class="hero-title">Intentional Tech</h1>
    <p class="hero-subtitle">The Story So Far...</p>
  </section>

  <section class="home-content">
    <YouTube
      id="LbpiB0vHA08"
      title="The Handhelds That Got Me Through The Year!"
      caption="Video: The Handhelds That Got Me Through The Year! • Intentional Tech • Uploaded Dec 26, 2025"
    />

    <div class="about-text">
      <p>
        <a href="https://youtube.com/@IntentionalTech" target="_blank">
          Intentional Tech
        </a> is a YouTube channel where I mostly review handheld tech devices. But it's
        also an attempt at sharing stories from my life through the medium of technology,
        which I hope at least some people can relate to.
      </p>
      <p>
        The journey began during the Covid pandemic, when I was simply trying to
        reclaim some of the agency and creativity that modern times had beaten out
        of me. Since then, it's followed me through huge changes in both the tech
        landscape and my life, not least the experience of becoming a father four
        years ago.
      </p>
      <p>
        Life is messy. It can't be nailed down to a 'niche'. So for a long time, I
        wasn't sure what to even cover on Intentional Tech. That was until recently,
        when I began to realise there was a whole host of 'casual' technology fans
        like me, many of whom also parents, who are in equal measure exhausted by
        the hyperbole of modern tech media and their own relentless daily grind.
      </p>
      <p>
        I hope I can offer a bit of comradery on this small corner of the internet.
        I believe that's a nice goal to work towards - but let's enjoy some cool new
        gadgets while we're at it.
      </p>
      <p class="sign-off">Chris</p>
    </div>

    <div class="home-ctas">
      <a
        href="https://www.youtube.com/@IntentionalTech"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="btn btn-youtube"
      >
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
          <path d="M23.5 6.19a3.02 3.02 0 0 0-2.12-2.14C19.54 3.5 12 3.5 12 3.5s-7.54 0-9.38.55A3.02 3.02 0 0 0 .5 6.19C0 8.04 0 12 0 12s0 3.96.5 5.81a3.02 3.02 0 0 0 2.12 2.14C4.46 20.5 12 20.5 12 20.5s7.54 0 9.38-.55a3.02 3.02 0 0 0 2.12-2.14C24 15.96 24 12 24 12s0-3.96-.5-5.81zM9.75 15.02V8.98L15.5 12l-5.75 3.02z"/>
        </svg>
        Watch on YouTube
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://intentionaltech.co.uk/blog"
        class="btn btn-blog"
      >
        <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
             stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"
             stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"/>
          <path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"/>
        </svg>
        Read the Blog
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://intentionaltech.co.uk/support"
        class="btn btn-support"
      >
        <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
          <path d="M12 21.35l-1.45-1.32C5.4 15.36 2 12.28 2 8.5 2 5.42 4.42 3 7.5 3c1.74 0 3.41.81 4.5 2.09C13.09 3.81 14.76 3 16.5 3 19.58 3 22 5.42 22 8.5c0 3.78-3.4 6.86-8.55 11.54L12 21.35z"/>
        </svg>
        Support
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  .hero {
    max-width: var(--content-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: calc(var(--nav-height) + 3rem) var(--content-padding) 2rem;
  }

  .hero-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-heading);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .home-content {
    max-width: var(--content-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--content-padding) 4rem;
  }

  .about-text p {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .about-text a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .sign-off {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--color-heading);
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .home-ctas {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      background-color var(--transition-fast),
      transform var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .btn-youtube {
    background: #ff0000;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .btn-youtube:hover {
    background: #cc0000;
  }

  .btn-blog {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .btn-blog:hover {
    background: var(--color-accent-hover);
  }

  .btn-support {
    background: #7c3aed;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .btn-support:hover {
    background: #6d28d9;
  }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    .btn-support {
      background: #8b5cf6;
    }

    .btn-support:hover {
      background: #7c3aed;
    }
  }
</style>
